<!-- ===================== IMPLEMENTATION ===================== -->
<h2>8. Implementation</h2>

<h3>8.1 Build & Compile Commands</h3>
<p>The following commands were used to compile and run the project:</p>

<div class="code-block>
# Compile the interactive GridGuard simulator
